  ('amber-jade', 65000, 'Warm taupe, greige and amber tones run in soft vertical layers across the surface, creating the calm, natural look of onyx. A sophisticated choice for spaces that call for warmth, texture and understated luxury.', 'Warm taupe, greige and amber tones run in soft vertical layers across the surface, creating the calm, natural look of onyx.', '{"Slab size": "3200 x 1600 x 12mm", "Thickness": "12mm", "Finish": "Polished", "Body composition": "Super White Body", "Recommended for": "Kitchen countertops, islands, vanity tops, feature walls and reception areas"}', 'one_face'),
